# Live Instagram Feed Connection for @waggin_with_gg
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set ANY ONE of the three variables below (locally in `.env` or in Vercel
# Project Settings -> Environment Variables) to automatically pull ALL live
# Instagram posts from https://www.instagram.com/waggin_with_gg/ via `/api/instagram`.
#
# Option 1 (Easiest - Free 1-click Instagram OAuth):
# Connect @waggin_with_gg at https://behold.so (JSON Feed) and paste the feed URL:
# INSTAGRAM_FEED_URL=https://feeds.behold.so/YOUR_FEED_ID

# Option 2 (Official Meta Instagram Graph API):
# Paste a long-lived Instagram User Access Token for @waggin_with_gg:
# INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=IGQWRO...

# Option 3 (Apify Public Profile Sync - no Instagram login required):
# Paste an Apify API token to sync public posts from @waggin_with_gg:
# APIFY_API_TOKEN=apify_api_...

# Optional: Set to true to expand multi-photo carousel posts into individual tiles
# INSTAGRAM_EXPAND_CAROUSELS=true

